cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss this research prototype, please cite the repository."
title: "poge_ai: a research prototype for an environment-native, memory-managed agent architecture"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "poge_ai contributors"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
version: "0.2.0"
license: "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KN-1998/poge_ai"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype exploring a small decision core that manages explicit memory
  tiers, routes actions between internal generation, memory access and tool execution,
  and is evaluated through heterogeneous review rather than a single benchmark.
  The repository ships a proposal, a staged research agenda, the original discussion
  archive, and a dependency-free Python baseline (SQLite memory, rule-based router,
  permission-scoped tools, JSONL tracing). It makes no validated performance claim.
keywords:
  - agent architecture
  - memory management
  - action routing
  - tool use
  - research prototype
